Never asks a member again for a want once it has answered NotAvailable, as
before 453ad5e, when that answer excluded it for good (§7.5 step 3): source
selection skips every member in the want's `answered` set, so the member's
later announcement of the wanted content puts it back among the sources but
it is still never selected, and a want whose sources all answered that way
stays without a source.

